(6656137, 995310, 86218, '<td valign="top">Wow... Great shot and you know what.. Im actually for the idea of kids spending time at the library/in books..:) 8 for the photo but the idea not strong enough for SOPA in the sense that it''s negative. Im however not taking away from the image in that sense</td>', 'Wow... Great shot and you know what.. Im actually for the idea of kids spending time at the library/in books..:) 8 for the photo but the idea not strong enough for SOPA in the sense that it''s negative. Im however not taking away from the image in that sense', '2012-01-27 01:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
