(6656840, 995310, 108069, '<td valign="top">It''s a killer image, and while I certainly agree with you on some level, disabling a vehicle of information isn''t doing us any favors. We could also burn those books so kids might actually engage more with their parents and community.</td>', 'It''s a killer image, and while I certainly agree with you on some level, disabling a vehicle of information isn''t doing us any favors. We could also burn those books so kids might actually engage more with their parents and community.', '2012-01-27 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6656841, 993990, 49018, '<td valign="top">I think I am getting your impression of twittering and facebooking :)<br/>Before reading the title I thought it might be "silent screams" as the post-processing very much reminds me of silent movies and the frozen instant is pretty dramatic.<br/>9</td>', 'I think I am getting your impression of twittering and facebooking :)Before reading the title I thought it might be "silent screams" as the post-processing very much reminds me of silent movies and the frozen instant is pretty dramatic.9', '2012-01-27 20:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6656843, 994423, 49018, '<td valign="top">I love idea, postprocessing, composition. The DOF makes for a dynamic image (assuming the image is straight from the camera, which it looks like). The only thing is that the image makes me think more of ''controlled fall'' than controlled freedom. If that was the intention, I understand that for you the act, and the ''controlled freedom but still freedom'', could have been after all a good thing.<br/>I tried looking at the image upside down, in order to reverse the concept :), and perhaps it would work by tilting the framing a bit, but ideally if the string was attached to the ''tail'' of the butterfly rather than the head.<br/>Just a thought though, I am not 100% sure of your intent.<br/>9</td>', 'I love idea, postprocessing, composition. The DOF makes for a dynamic image (assuming the image is straight from the camera, which it looks like). The only thing is that the image makes me think more of ''controlled fall'' than controlled freedom. If that was the intention, I understand that for you the act, and the ''controlled freedom but still freedom'', could have been after all a good thing.I tried looking at the image upside down, in order to reverse the concept :), and perhaps it would work by tilting the framing a bit, but ideally if the string was attached to the ''tail'' of the butterfly rather than the head.Just a thought though, I am not 100% sure of your intent.9', '2012-01-27 20:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6656847, 995136, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''d assume this is sarcasm, but I see no connection in the image that it is. Interesting image, poor choice of title. I''m interested to see what your message was, but, at least on me, it didn''t hit.</td>', 'I''d assume this is sarcasm, but I see no connection in the image that it is. Interesting image, poor choice of title. I''m interested to see what your message was, but, at least on me, it didn''t hit.', '2012-01-27 20:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6656858, 995268, 108069, '<td valign="top">Superb metaphor. The belly is a bit too flawless and other things about it remind me of a movie poster, but it''s right on target and one of my favorites. Well done.</td>', 'Superb metaphor. The belly is a bit too flawless and other things about it remind me of a movie poster, but it''s right on target and one of my favorites. Well done.', '2012-01-27 20:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
