(6656972, 995211, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is a very poignant and eloquent image which speaks volumes without words. I like how the light rays from outside paint &amp; illuminate the trees, but the photographer has given up and is moving on with his tripod. "Nothing to see here, go home" - and the ever omnipresent dark bird, in silhouette, flies into frame, subtly chasing him.  I do love this - even the sepia reminds me of yesterday more than today. SOPA passing would be a future to be feared.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a very poignant and eloquent image which speaks volumes without words. I like how the light rays from outside paint & illuminate the trees, but the photographer has given up and is moving on with his tripod. "Nothing to see here, go home" - and the ever omnipresent dark bird, in silhouette, flies into frame, subtly chasing him.  I do love this - even the sepia reminds me of yesterday more than today. SOPA passing would be a future to be feared.  Well done!', '2012-01-27 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
