(6662161, 995264, 137576, '<td valign="top">congrats on the blue Christoph :) hehe i like the shadow detail and they''re awkward movement. the only thing id say and this is not detrimental to your score but i can tell teh fire is a small fire not a large fire, i burn a lot of large fires clearing sites and demolition and theres something about a large fire. great work though, i hope no books were harmed in the making of this photo ;) <br/> <br/>although looking through i think the library photo is going to give you a very good run for your money</td>', 'congrats on the blue Christoph :) hehe i like the shadow detail and they''re awkward movement. the only thing id say and this is not detrimental to your score but i can tell teh fire is a small fire not a large fire, i burn a lot of large fires clearing sites and demolition and theres something about a large fire. great work though, i hope no books were harmed in the making of this photo ;)  although looking through i think the library photo is going to give you a very good run for your money', '2012-02-02 15:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
