(6662970, 995211, 30364, '<td valign="top">Hey Nicky, this is pretty cool.  I''ll give you $0.33 for it, ok?  Haha ... all right, you win; a dollar.<br/> <br/>Seriously, you have what many of your ''betters'' from that stupid forum thread don''t, and I do <i>not</i> mean youth. You have exceptional talent, judgement and good taste.  I''ll expect to see your name on many things outside of DPC in the future.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hey Nicky, this is pretty cool.  I''ll give you $0.33 for it, ok?  Haha ... all right, you win; a dollar. Seriously, you have what many of your ''betters'' from that stupid forum thread don''t, and I do not mean youth. You have exceptional talent, judgement and good taste.  I''ll expect to see your name on many things outside of DPC in the future. ', '2012-02-03 09:36:21.000000', NULL, 0),
