(6663187, 995264, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ha! I knew a low 7 couldn''t stand. :)<br/> <br/>Awesome compilation! I guess I low-balled you with the 9 I gave you. 10s being the most frequent.<br/> <br/>However, when I read: "Everyone knows that people raised outdoors are much tastier than battery farmed ones... looks like it''s the same for human beings." I started wondering about you a bit. Then I realized that I was way too tired, and started wondering about me a bit!<br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Ha! I knew a low 7 couldn''t stand. :) Awesome compilation! I guess I low-balled you with the 9 I gave you. 10s being the most frequent. However, when I read: "Everyone knows that people raised outdoors are much tastier than battery farmed ones... looks like it''s the same for human beings." I started wondering about you a bit. Then I realized that I was way too tired, and started wondering about me a bit! Congrats!', '2012-02-03 14:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
