(6663247, 995211, 20608, '<td valign="top">I wish I had your talent when I were your age, sadly I was playing Football(soccer) instead.</td>', 'I wish I had your talent when I were your age, sadly I was playing Football(soccer) instead.', '2012-02-03 16:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6663256, 995264, 117474, '<td valign="top">Of course we all knew this was you :-) <br/>Initially I thought to myself "he missed a trick, he''s burning books not the Internet! Quelle fromage!?" but then I thought about it a bit more and realised this shows the cyclic nature of history. Great image.</td>', 'Of course we all knew this was you :-) Initially I thought to myself "he missed a trick, he''s burning books not the Internet! Quelle fromage!?" but then I thought about it a bit more and realised this shows the cyclic nature of history. Great image.', '2012-02-03 16:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6663610, 995219, 102278, '<td valign="top">Kafkaesque. Fantastic Ben.</td>', 'Kafkaesque. Fantastic Ben.', '2012-02-04 06:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6663884, 995268, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is executed very well and quite clever too.  Glad to see it exceeded your initial expectations.  Congrats on the yellow!</td>', 'This is executed very well and quite clever too.  Glad to see it exceeded your initial expectations.  Congrats on the yellow!', '2012-02-04 13:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6663916, 995264, 112972, '<td valign="top">I have seen better composites from you and this may be my least favorite of them all.  I feel like some of the elements have not been merged together smoothly, especially the burning books in the air, it looks too much like they were pasted in there because their lighting, brightness, and sharpness don''t quite match with the rest of the image.  It took me awhile to figure out what the image was trying to say because the books are not clearly visible at all which is what this image is all about ... burning books.  I am sure this was partly due to the limited image size (only 800 pixels), but I would have placed a book much, much closer and larger to the viewer in order for the viewer to understand immediately books are the main thing we are talking about here instead of searching for them mainly in the darkness.  Fire could have been better too.  Still great job in the short amount of time that you had and congrats on the blue and I hope you don''t mind some critiques from me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-04 14:36:09.</i></td>', 'I have seen better composites from you and this may be my least favorite of them all.  I feel like some of the elements have not been merged together smoothly, especially the burning books in the air, it looks too much like they were pasted in there because their lighting, brightness, and sharpness don''t quite match with the rest of the image.  It took me awhile to figure out what the image was trying to say because the books are not clearly visible at all which is what this image is all about ... burning books.  I am sure this was partly due to the limited image size (only 800 pixels), but I would have placed a book much, much closer and larger to the viewer in order for the viewer to understand immediately books are the main thing we are talking about here instead of searching for them mainly in the darkness.  Fire could have been better too.  Still great job in the short amount of time that you had and congrats on the blue and I hope you don''t mind some critiques from me.', '2012-02-04 14:34:57.000000', '2012-02-04 14:36:09.000000', 0),
(6663982, 995232, 68956, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and funny :)</td>', 'Wonderful and funny :)', '2012-02-04 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6664125, 995268, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, very well executed!  How did you get the lettering to be so integral to the yarn?  Congrats on the well-deserved ribbon!  (PS - nothing wrong with golf - fine sport.  I just need to find people who want to play around here and I can give up challenges altogether.)</td>', 'Excellent idea, very well executed!  How did you get the lettering to be so integral to the yarn?  Congrats on the well-deserved ribbon!  (PS - nothing wrong with golf - fine sport.  I just need to find people who want to play around here and I can give up challenges altogether.)', '2012-02-04 21:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6664192, 995268, 90947, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot IMNSHO; not only from a philosophical, but from artistic and technical standpoints.  I am not sure what you did in Photoshoppe.  It looks like a real sweater that you had, perhaps tailored, with the word.  The unraveling threads even have the blue and red.  I just love it.  (Nice tummy as well.)<br/> <br/>Contratulations.</td>', 'This is a great shot IMNSHO; not only from a philosophical, but from artistic and technical standpoints.  I am not sure what you did in Photoshoppe.  It looks like a real sweater that you had, perhaps tailored, with the word.  The unraveling threads even have the blue and red.  I just love it.  (Nice tummy as well.) Contratulations.', '2012-02-04 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
